WEBVTT

00:20.850 --> 00:26.820
If I was dreaming, how did I forget?

00:26.890 --> 00:30.660
It pulsed through me, frigid, shocked me

00:30.660 --> 00:32.300
Can I do, do?

00:32.960 --> 00:37.960
I want you next to me when I summon you

00:39.130 --> 00:42.970
Waiting close by, but you seem far off

00:42.970 --> 00:45.310
Na, na, na, knight

00:45.310 --> 00:48.480
The more beautiful the rose

00:48.480 --> 00:51.450
The more its thorns hurt

00:51.450 --> 00:54.720
Now that I'm strong

00:54.720 --> 00:59.720
My heart knows to protect that vow

01:00.720 --> 01:03.760
Let's meet in the dark of night

01:03.760 --> 01:06.830
Where you're waiting

01:06.830 --> 01:09.830
You'll worship the cruel Dark Queen

01:09.830 --> 01:13.000
Who's drunk with danger

01:13.000 --> 01:15.970
You shattered the glass sword

01:15.970 --> 01:18.940
You wielded without thinking

01:18.940 --> 01:21.880
Its shards glow in the night

01:21.880 --> 01:25.350
I lick your wounded fingers

01:36.360 --> 01:38.340
Hot damn, Bucchi!

01:38.960 --> 01:42.030
Awesome!

01:42.460 --> 01:44.440
Th..This one...

01:47.070 --> 01:49.050
It's too much!

01:50.270 --> 01:51.870
Aren't they great?

01:51.870 --> 01:53.740
You've redeemed yourself, Bucchi!

01:53.740 --> 01:56.240
But that's not all.

01:56.240 --> 01:57.180
What?!

01:57.180 --> 01:59.490
Take a good look at those pictures.

02:00.450 --> 02:04.390
See the boy that's in every picture?

02:04.390 --> 02:06.890
Th..That jerk...

02:11.230 --> 02:13.090
Who is he again?

02:18.100 --> 02:19.910
This is his home.

02:21.140 --> 02:22.540
Hiro Hiyorimi...

02:22.540 --> 02:25.640
I've been following him and traced him here.

02:25.640 --> 02:28.610
Those hotties live here?

02:28.610 --> 02:29.940
I'm certain of it.

02:29.950 --> 02:32.310
But why do we have to sneak in?

02:32.310 --> 02:33.480
It's obvious.

02:33.480 --> 02:38.120
There's no point in solving the mystery
unless we do it ourselves!

02:38.120 --> 02:39.320
Huga.

02:39.320 --> 02:41.990
I'm aware. Intruders, right?

02:41.990 --> 02:44.290
What do they think they're doing?

02:44.290 --> 02:46.270
I can see their every move.

02:46.630 --> 02:47.630
Begin the operation!

02:51.000 --> 02:54.470
Oh, what a shame, they won't be moving
on to the third round.

02:59.740 --> 03:02.240
Hey, aren't you guys...

03:03.080 --> 03:04.680
H..Hiro?

03:04.680 --> 03:06.650
That's not a hottie!

03:06.650 --> 03:08.630
Hiro, do you know these guys?

03:09.020 --> 03:10.660
Huga.

03:11.550 --> 03:13.350
Hotties spotted!

03:13.360 --> 03:15.160
A photo chance!

03:19.090 --> 03:20.900
What the heck?

03:26.400 --> 03:28.380
Pretty loud guys, huh?

03:32.910 --> 03:34.610
You made all that?

03:34.610 --> 03:37.950
Yeah! I'm so happy!

03:37.950 --> 03:42.450
It's the first time your friends have come over!

03:43.120 --> 03:46.550
Are those guys friends?

03:46.560 --> 03:49.160
We've barely talked at school.

03:49.160 --> 03:52.490
They came over to play because
they're your friends!

03:52.490 --> 03:55.030
Okay, I'll take this out to them.

03:55.030 --> 03:56.840
No, no!

04:05.670 --> 04:09.940
When the heck did you have those
death traps installed?

04:09.950 --> 04:12.950
This merchant from the Royal Kingdom
was so persistent.

04:12.950 --> 04:15.430
I said I didn't need them,
but he installed them anyway.

04:16.020 --> 04:18.520
They're a good way to kill time.

04:19.090 --> 04:20.590
I've got more of them, too.

04:20.590 --> 04:24.160
Be careful not to get caught in them.

04:24.160 --> 04:28.940
Hah! Don't group me in with those weak boys.

04:35.840 --> 04:37.770
Hey, did you see her?

04:37.770 --> 04:38.810
Yup!

04:38.810 --> 04:41.510
You saw her, right? The gorgeous maid?!
You saw her, right?

04:41.510 --> 04:47.830
The one that went squish-squish-squish-squish,
squish-squish-squish-squish!

04:48.450 --> 04:48.720
Squish-squish-squish-squish

04:48.720 --> 04:51.950
But that young girl, Liza...

04:51.950 --> 04:55.960
All those firm muscles... Awesome!

04:55.960 --> 04:57.760
Muscles, muscles, muscles...

04:57.760 --> 04:59.630
Squish-squish-squish-squish!
It's all about the squish-squish!

04:59.630 --> 05:00.900
Muscles!

05:00.900 --> 05:02.300
Squish-squish!

05:02.300 --> 05:03.360
You bastard!

05:03.370 --> 05:05.350
You're so immature, you two.

05:09.000 --> 05:11.740
That blonde princess...

05:11.740 --> 05:13.140
Her eyes...

05:13.140 --> 05:14.580
Her lips...

05:14.580 --> 05:16.440
Her legs...

05:16.440 --> 05:18.310
I want her to scowl at me!

05:18.310 --> 05:19.910
I want her to belittle me!

05:19.920 --> 05:21.520
I want her to step on me!

05:21.520 --> 05:23.720
Are you a masochist?

05:23.720 --> 05:25.550
But listen, guys,

05:25.550 --> 05:28.900
aren't we forgetting something critical?

05:31.260 --> 05:34.730
Why are those hotties with Hiro?

05:35.300 --> 05:37.300
Th..That's a good question!

05:37.300 --> 05:39.250
I brought you some tea.

05:39.900 --> 05:42.300
Damn, you Hiro! You jerk!

05:42.300 --> 05:44.370
Why are in a place like this?!

05:44.370 --> 05:45.810
What are you upset about exactly?

05:45.810 --> 05:47.540
We demand an explanation.

05:47.540 --> 05:50.910
You don't stand out in class,
your grades are terrible,

05:50.910 --> 05:53.350
and about three times a day I realize,
"Oh? You were here all along?"

05:53.350 --> 05:55.990
And yet you're here?!

05:56.720 --> 05:59.090
Geez, you're ripping into me.

05:59.090 --> 06:01.120
What are you three here for anyway?!

06:01.120 --> 06:03.320
I asked you first!

06:03.330 --> 06:07.300
Ah! I..l apologize!

06:22.980 --> 06:26.950
All right, I guess I'll rest until nightfall.

06:30.820 --> 06:33.490
Oh, Hiro has friends over?

06:34.090 --> 06:38.560
Intriguing, isn't it?

06:39.360 --> 06:41.460
Why am I here?

06:41.460 --> 06:46.410
My Big Sister is a live-in maid here,
so I tagged along.

06:46.870 --> 06:50.170
And Liza is friends with Hime.

06:50.170 --> 06:53.470
That squishy-squishy maid is your sister?

06:53.480 --> 06:55.610
She's working for the princess?

06:55.610 --> 06:58.320
And you live with that muscle-bound girl, too?!

07:02.780 --> 07:07.780
For dinner tonight, I'm going to make
all your favorite things, Bucchi!

07:09.220 --> 07:12.760
You've made me so happy, Big Sis!

07:15.360 --> 07:18.130
Let's race to the pickle store!

07:18.130 --> 07:19.700
On your mark...

07:20.100 --> 07:23.570
Wait for me, Big Sis!

07:24.240 --> 07:27.310
Catch me if you can!

07:36.480 --> 07:38.960
I need to take a break, Liza.

07:40.590 --> 07:43.860
Pathetic, and you call yourself a man.

07:43.860 --> 07:45.490
That's so cold.

07:45.490 --> 07:48.760
Come on, cheer up.

07:48.760 --> 07:51.970
I'll train with you every day.

07:53.230 --> 07:54.940
So hurry...

07:54.940 --> 07:56.180
Liza...

07:57.810 --> 08:03.650
Hurry and become a strong man who
will be able to protect me.

08:11.220 --> 08:14.420
I'm your mistress from today on.

08:14.420 --> 08:18.260
Does that please you?

08:22.000 --> 08:24.810
I don't know of any pet that says "Yes, ma'am".

08:31.140 --> 08:33.310
I don't need a dog.

08:33.310 --> 08:35.620
You're 8 pig!

08:45.550 --> 08:50.160
Squishy-squishy Big Sis,
shopping with you makes me so happy!

08:50.160 --> 08:55.160
The feminine heart of a muscle-bound girl
is worth its weight in gold!

08:56.360 --> 08:59.640
Scowl at me, belittle me, walk all over me!

09:00.570 --> 09:05.780
I don't know what's going on, but I think
I should get the heck out of here.

09:08.180 --> 09:13.180
Do you really think we'll let you keep that amazing
lifestyle all to yourself, you jerk?

09:13.250 --> 09:15.550
I don't know what you're talking about!

09:15.550 --> 09:17.080
You don't?

09:17.090 --> 09:21.460
You're living the reality that makes
all men on Earth envious!

09:21.460 --> 09:26.410
There's nothing good about it!
I feel like I might die at any moment!

09:28.000 --> 09:31.070
No, I mean...

09:31.070 --> 09:34.440
I'm not just freeloading here.

09:34.440 --> 09:38.210
I'm like their bodyguard of sorts.
It's actually a lot of work.

09:38.210 --> 09:41.980
How could a weakling like you
ever be a bodyguard?!

09:41.980 --> 09:44.710
You've gotten a big head from all this!

09:44.710 --> 09:47.750
From all men across the globe, kick!

09:59.290 --> 10:02.330
What's gotten into those guys?

10:02.330 --> 10:05.330
What did they come here for?

10:12.440 --> 10:14.840
You wish to work for me?

10:14.840 --> 10:16.910
Yes, Your Highness.

10:16.910 --> 10:20.150
We'd like to be your new bodyguards
in this mansion.

10:20.150 --> 10:23.390
I'd like to work out with Liza!

10:23.650 --> 10:24.850
And me, too.

10:24.850 --> 10:28.670
I'd like to live in the room next to your live-in maid.

10:31.790 --> 10:34.770
What do you think, Your Highness?

10:35.360 --> 10:38.600
Doesn't look like they're leaving any time soon.

10:38.600 --> 10:41.510
Doesn't sound like a bad deal to me.

10:42.570 --> 10:44.310
Sherwood...

10:45.510 --> 10:48.820
Oh baby! More hotties incoming!

10:49.840 --> 10:52.590
A maid with glasses, incredible!

10:53.980 --> 10:58.550
We don't have any entertainment
like this at my place,

10:58.550 --> 11:00.550
it's boring.

11:00.560 --> 11:02.590
Who are you calling entertainment?!

11:02.590 --> 11:06.230
Isn't having all these subjects here troublesome?

11:07.960 --> 11:11.670
Very well, since you're so insistent,
I'll allow you a trial.

11:11.670 --> 11:15.480
If you pass, you will be at my beck
and call as my servants.

11:16.470 --> 11:17.910
Hiro,

11:17.910 --> 11:19.780
you should join them, too.

11:20.610 --> 11:22.420
Yes, ma'am.

11:23.310 --> 11:25.950
You'll be fired in an instant if you lose.

11:27.150 --> 11:28.960
Very well, Your Highness.

11:29.420 --> 11:31.420
What's gotten into Hiro?

11:31.420 --> 11:33.230
He's creeping me out.

11:34.920 --> 11:39.240
Princess Sherwood, you're looking lovely today.

11:40.060 --> 11:45.060
What? Hiro's an even greater man
than he usually is today!

11:45.470 --> 11:46.530
Huga.

11:46.530 --> 11:50.310
We will not lose!

12:10.160 --> 12:11.560
All right...

12:11.560 --> 12:15.430
The first one to reach my sister wins...

12:15.430 --> 12:18.070
And plenty of booby-traps have been planted.

12:18.730 --> 12:21.210
On your marks, get set...

12:24.610 --> 12:26.240
Go!

12:31.480 --> 12:35.150
Wait! There might be traps if you go directly in!

12:36.450 --> 12:39.320
There're other ways besides going in directly.

12:39.320 --> 12:40.960
Okay...

12:46.390 --> 12:48.030
Huga.

12:53.840 --> 12:56.650
There are plenty of traps left.

13:00.210 --> 13:03.280
Hiro's in the lead.
Please stop him, Francesca.

13:08.280 --> 13:10.120
A photo chance!

13:10.120 --> 13:11.760
Huga.

13:12.250 --> 13:14.220
I'm sorry.

13:14.220 --> 13:19.220
If Hiro wins, he'll belong to my sister once again.

13:20.060 --> 13:21.700
Huga.

13:23.300 --> 13:25.630
I love strong women.

13:25.630 --> 13:28.540
How about it? Let's go out for coffee sometime.

13:28.540 --> 13:30.170
Huga.

13:32.570 --> 13:34.240
A battle maid!

13:59.430 --> 14:01.410
You're so cool, Hiro!

14:01.800 --> 14:06.370
But I can't let you reach the goal first.

14:06.370 --> 14:10.620
But I don't want to stop watching
Hiro looking so cool, either.

14:11.110 --> 14:14.320
Whatever should I do?

14:15.280 --> 14:18.350
It's always so lively, whenever I come here.

14:18.350 --> 14:19.650
Hold it, Hiro!

14:19.650 --> 14:22.640
We're not letting you live in this mansion
with those hotties alone!

14:25.960 --> 14:28.460
It's nice to see you, Princess Sherwood.

14:28.460 --> 14:30.370
Don't interfere, you vampire!

14:30.870 --> 14:35.370
Oh, heavens no, I have no interest
in such an idiotic competition.

14:36.070 --> 14:41.070
Pardon my bluntness, but "hotties"?

14:41.880 --> 14:45.380
Seems those boys need to be shown
the error of their ways.

14:46.410 --> 14:48.920
I can't move with these things in the way!

14:50.020 --> 14:51.830
It's sucking my blood!

14:52.220 --> 14:54.520
Oh, this is awesome.

14:54.520 --> 14:57.390
It's not often you get to photograph
a blood-sucking scene.

14:57.390 --> 15:01.030
If only you were maids, it would be the best!

15:03.630 --> 15:05.440
Here goes!

15:09.140 --> 15:11.340
Farewell, Bucchi.

15:11.340 --> 15:13.980
We won't let your death be in vain.

15:14.510 --> 15:16.650
Th..They're sucking my blood...

15:17.150 --> 15:19.490
...down to the very last drop.

16:14.440 --> 16:17.010
Not bad...

16:17.940 --> 16:23.390
Hiro's in the lead?
Who would have ever thought?

16:24.980 --> 16:27.320
That's my Hiro.

16:27.380 --> 16:29.020
Huga.

16:30.120 --> 16:31.790
No good...

16:31.790 --> 16:34.720
Let's call it quits.

16:34.720 --> 16:38.900
We'll never get out of here alive!

16:41.130 --> 16:42.770
Yoshida?!

16:43.300 --> 16:45.280
The weaklings can go home.

16:45.770 --> 16:48.470
Pm Qoing on!

16:48.470 --> 16:51.510
Yoshida! Why?

16:51.510 --> 16:53.650
Why are YOU doing that?!

16:54.440 --> 16:57.280
Because I can see it.

16:57.280 --> 17:00.890
I can see the gorgeous princess waiting for me.

17:07.260 --> 17:11.790
Rapunzel, Rapunzel, let down your hair.

17:11.790 --> 17:13.730
Call to me.

17:13.730 --> 17:16.900
She's my Rapunzel.

17:18.270 --> 17:21.700
I've found someone I'd give my life to be with.

17:21.700 --> 17:23.680
She's my everything.

17:24.170 --> 17:26.170
You...

17:26.370 --> 17:27.940
I'm going, too!

17:27.940 --> 17:30.780
For my princess: Liza!

17:30.780 --> 17:32.180
That's the spirit!

17:32.180 --> 17:36.360
All men, worldwide, have a princess
within their heart!

17:44.860 --> 17:48.100
My name is Liza Wildman.

17:48.300 --> 17:52.240
I'm the daughter of the mighty warrior,
Worg Wildman!

17:52.800 --> 17:54.870
Hime waits beyond me.

17:54.870 --> 17:56.680
If you want to win,

17:57.410 --> 17:59.750
you'll have to defeat me first!

18:04.880 --> 18:06.050
There...

18:06.050 --> 18:07.450
A photo chance.

18:07.450 --> 18:12.020
Okay, pain, pain, go away!

18:12.450 --> 18:14.330
"'8 gone!

18:15.090 --> 18:17.070
Wait, here too.

18:19.460 --> 18:22.200
It's like Shangri-Ia!

18:22.200 --> 18:23.200
Squish-squish!

18:23.200 --> 18:24.600
Squish-squish! Squish-squish!

18:24.600 --> 18:26.580
Squish-squish-squish-squish...

18:27.640 --> 18:29.070
Squish-squish...

18:29.070 --> 18:31.810
Huh? What happened?

18:31.810 --> 18:33.440
Hello?

18:34.910 --> 18:37.040
What should I do?

18:37.040 --> 18:39.550
Come on! Bring it!

18:39.550 --> 18:42.030
Wow! It's Liza!

18:44.850 --> 18:48.150
What's this? Your training methods are all wrong!

18:48.160 --> 18:50.660
You need to eat more meat! Meat!

18:53.190 --> 18:55.800
Liza's meaty paw...

18:56.630 --> 18:58.800
It's incredible!

19:00.400 --> 19:02.380
You're creeping me out!

19:03.940 --> 19:05.410
Murayama!

19:05.410 --> 19:08.080
Liza's bark...

19:10.180 --> 19:13.150
What the hell are you thinking?

19:13.150 --> 19:16.250
Hiro, you need to do a better job
picking your friends!

19:17.490 --> 19:19.120
Hiro?

19:20.290 --> 19:23.990
You? That's unusual.

19:23.990 --> 19:26.800
Whatever, bring it.

19:27.860 --> 19:29.500
Hiro?!

19:34.500 --> 19:36.240
Ow, ow...

19:36.240 --> 19:38.410
Hiro, you...

19:38.410 --> 19:40.220
What on Earth?

19:45.980 --> 19:47.960
Is that you, Hiro?

19:48.750 --> 19:50.730
I finished in first place.

19:51.720 --> 19:53.600
You did well.

19:55.020 --> 19:57.260
That's strange.

19:57.260 --> 20:00.260
Since when did your body stop
healing its injuries?

20:02.800 --> 20:05.370
Hime, die!

20:20.250 --> 20:23.090
A race that's skilled at transformations...

20:29.560 --> 20:30.960
Flandre.

20:30.960 --> 20:32.600
Huga!

20:39.770 --> 20:41.640
Liquid nitrogen...

20:42.600 --> 20:44.840
I'll have to commend you before you freeze.

20:44.840 --> 20:47.580
Your transformation skills are impressive,

20:48.080 --> 20:51.890
but you made yourself better than the original.

20:59.950 --> 21:04.060
My Rapunzel...

21:04.060 --> 21:09.670
Please, please, wrap me in your golden locks.

21:10.260 --> 21:13.670
Or you can step on me.

21:13.670 --> 21:16.170
Please, please...

21:18.340 --> 21:20.710
Flandre, bring me a new pair of shoes.

21:20.710 --> 21:22.350
Huga!

21:39.160 --> 21:43.960
Hey, the inside of the mansion is all in shambles.
Did something happen?

21:43.960 --> 21:45.170
Hiro...

21:45.170 --> 21:46.800
Yes?

21:47.570 --> 21:49.710
Choose your friends carefully.

21:56.380 --> 21:59.320
Data Deleted

22:13.030 --> 22:18.030
Get down on your knees and lick my red nails

22:18.600 --> 22:26.540
Call me queen with your entangled tongue

22:29.110 --> 22:31.880
The sun that blooms in Hell

22:31.880 --> 22:34.610
Darkness that's fallen to Paradise

22:34.620 --> 22:37.180
If you're confronted with light and despair

22:37.180 --> 22:39.820
Which one goes deeper?

22:39.820 --> 22:42.560
Roses fly from my head

22:42.560 --> 22:45.260
I'll scatter them into Nirvana

22:45.260 --> 22:47.860
Wounds that secretly pain you

22:47.860 --> 22:50.430
Blood that gushes away

22:50.500 --> 22:53.130
They both lead to the depths of my heart

22:53.130 --> 22:55.800
You've given these gorgeous gifts as tribute

22:55.800 --> 22:58.470
And yet you're still

22:58.470 --> 23:01.170
Seeking love?

23:01.180 --> 23:03.910
Tell me exactly to what extent

23:03.910 --> 23:06.580
Grown men are just foolish little boys?

23:06.580 --> 23:11.580
Get down on your knees and lick my sacred feet

23:11.850 --> 23:16.850
Call me queen in your hoarse voice

23:17.290 --> 23:22.290
The proof of your life creeps up the tower of pain

23:22.530 --> 23:25.230
Slowly making your way, you can barely breathe

23:25.230 --> 23:27.870
But if you still ask for it

23:27.870 --> 23:31.840
Your dying breath just might be

23:31.840 --> 23:40.120
The words that melt my frozen tears

23:41.950 --> 23:42.980
Huga.

23:42.980 --> 23:45.620
Hiro, why is the refrigerator door open?

23:45.620 --> 23:50.620
Liza's feeling down, so I thought she might
cheer up if I got some food for her.

23:51.190 --> 23:56.190
Oh? I could have sworn you were planning
on going inside the fridge.

23:56.400 --> 24:00.070
Huh? Go inside the fridge?
Why would I do that?

24:00.070 --> 24:01.070
Huga?

24:01.070 --> 24:03.400
Next episode, "Princess Succession"

24:03.400 --> 24:06.870
Hey, do you hate thunder and lightning too, Hime?

24:06.870 --> 24:07.870
Why do you think that?

24:08.740 --> 24:10.780
Huga, huga.
